			"notes": "- Added 3 config options to allow players to 'inspect' other players with a spyglass for a few sections to reveal their Archetype. The configs change whether the inspection is enabled, how long the inspection takes, and whether the other player is alerted of being inspected.\n- Added a command to allow spirit mounts to have a name.\n- Parrots now get poisoned from eating cookies\n- Added a config to cap the damage returned from the Thorny trait (default: 20.0)\n- Added an infographic to the Readme"
		},
